`]}),e.jsxs(n,{title:"Each mechanism cuts one cost and pays with another",children:[e.jsx(t.p,{children:"The question for this lecture was what limits attention on a GPU, arithmetic or bytes, and how modern models cut that cost. Whichever resource binds for the workload limits it, and each mechanism cuts one cost and pays with another. Five quantities keep them apart:"}),e.jsxs(t.ol,{children:[`
`,e.jsx(t.li,{children:"the semantic reach, which earlier tokens can influence a query;"}),`
`,e.jsx(t.li,{children:"the cache stored for each token;"}),`
